# Data & Files

## Structure

- `Data/Inputs/`: Input files (GymLeaderPokemon.txt, GymLeaderTeams.json, etc.). Paths configurable in Settings.
- `Data/Outputs/`: Generated PNG, CSV. Only allowlisted files are served.
- `Data/UsefulDatasets/`: Dex fetch script. Run once for Team Builder.

## Config

- Simulator scripts read `config.json` (flat format) when run. Written by `services.py`.
- Do not commit `config.json` if it contains user-specific paths. Add to .gitignore if needed.

## Scripts

- Python scripts in `Data/` are invoked by `services.run_script()` or `run_script_background()`.
- They run from `Data/` as cwd. Use relative paths from `Data/`.

## Performance

- Long-running simulations run in background. Frontend polls `/api/status`.
- Avoid loading entire output.txt into memory; stream if possible for very large files.
- Dex JSON files: keep reasonably sized. Load on demand by frontend.
